              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.143.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Olke 143.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.3.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Irm 3.20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.3.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kake kiyiolo ake iyiook aajo mme te nkitabaroto oo Nkitanapat meitoki Enkai aatakinore oltung'ani, kake enkirukoto eimu ina ti atua Yesu Kristo; naa ore iyiook ate enkaraki enkirukoto ti atua Kristo Yesu meekure eetakinore Enkai iyiook, mme nkitanapat kintabaitie. Anaa enajo Lkigerot, “Meetae hoo obo laa enkitabaroto oo Nkitanapat eimua pee meekure eetakinore Enkai ninye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake amaa te neaku te ina naitaasi iyiook te nkaraki Kristo meitoki Enkai aatakinore iyiook te nkaraki Kristo neitokini aanyorriki nchere kira laasak loo ng'ok anaa enatiu Loreren, keaku ina eji ng'ok eisiaaita Kristo? Mme neijia pae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Te neaku ilo rrekie loo Nkitanapat laturoyie aitoki aitasheyie, neitoduaaya naa ina nchere kesipa kara olotigila nkitanapat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ore te nanu nena Kitanapat ate naaiting'ie enkishui ai naitore nena Kitanapat. Ore ti alo nena Kitanapat atua nanu, peyie atum ataa kaishu te nkaraki Enkai. Etashoki Kristo naatashoki nanu te nebo ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aatashoki nanu tenebo Kristo, meekure aa nanu oishu, kake etaa Kristo oishu tiatua nanu. Ore enkishui naishu nanu taata to sesen, naishu te nkirukoto, natii atua enkerai e Nkai Ilo laatonyorra nanu neishoru kewan te nkaraki nanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nemaany nanu empiris e Nkai. Te neaku te nkitabaroto oo nkitanapat eikenakini oltung'ani esipata nemeitoki naa enkeeya e Kristo aata tipat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
